// Guided build step 7: the alert rule query. Every Defender for AI services alert in the last 15 minutes,
// whatever its severity. Use it in an Azure Monitor log search alert rule (evaluate every 5 minutes, threshold > 0)
// or as a Microsoft Sentinel scheduled analytics rule.
SecurityAlert
| where TimeGenerated > ago(15m)
| where AlertType startswith "AI."
| project TimeGenerated, AlertSeverity, AlertName, AlertType, CompromisedEntity, SystemAlertId
